"headers."
msgstr ""
"Secondes Unix dans la charge utile (séparée de l'en-tête). Vous permet de "
"signer les charges utiles sans envoyer l'en-tête — pratique pour les "
"fournisseurs qui suppriment les en-têtes personnalisés."

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:213 includes/helpers.php:810
msgid "Stripe"
msgstr "Stripe"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:215
msgid "Stripe Dashboard → Developers → Webhooks → Add endpoint."
msgstr ""
"Tableau de bord Stripe → Développeurs → Webhooks → Ajouter un point de "
"terminaison."

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:216
msgid ""
"Paste the Webhook URL above; subscribe to event `checkout.session.completed` "
"(or `payment_intent.succeeded` if you use raw PaymentIntents)."
msgstr ""
"Collez l'URL du Webhook ci-dessus ; abonnez-vous à l'événement "
"`checkout.session.completed` (ou `payment_intent.succeeded` si vous utilisez "
"des PaymentIntents bruts)."

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:217
msgid ""
"Stripe signs with its own header (`Stripe-Signature`). Listora does NOT read "
"that header — you need a tiny relay (Cloudflare Worker, custom mu-plugin, or "
"Pipedream) that re-signs Stripe's payload as `<timestamp>.<body>` with the "
"Listora secret and POSTs here. A 20-line example lives in `docs/integrations/"
"stripe-relay.md`."
msgstr ""
"Stripe signe avec son propre en-tête (`Stripe-Signature`). Listora ne lit "
"PAS cet en-tête — vous avez besoin d'un petit relais (Cloudflare Worker, mu-"
"plugin personnalisé ou Pipedream) qui re-signe la charge utile de Stripe en "
"tant que `<timestamp>.<body>` avec le secret Listora et envoie un POST ici. "
"Un exemple de 20 lignes se trouve dans `docs/integrations/stripe-relay.md`."

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:218
msgid "In the relay, map Stripe fields → Listora fields:"
msgstr "Dans le relais, mappez les champs Stripe → champs Listora :"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:221 includes/helpers.php:811
msgid "PayPal"
msgstr "PayPal"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:223
